  "abstract": "Ablation to isolate dynamic vs static effect: increase dynamic MoT residual to \u03b1=0.07 (matching static MoT) with identical R=4, ctx_hidden=64, and regularizers. Tests whether prior regression was due to under-scaled residual.",
